      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "今、カスタリア地方へ行こうとすると\nフーゴ関に怪しい連中がいて進めないんだ。\n……あそこ、通れないと困るなあ。\n誰か連中を追っ払ってくれないかなあ。",
        "official_en": "There's some nasty people blocking the road at\nHugo Stronghold. I wish someone would chase\nthem away. I need to get through!",
        "real_en": "There's some nasty people blocking the road at\nFugo Stronghold. I wish someone would chase\nthem away. I need to get through!"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
